{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2022-11-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE INTRODUCES NEXT-GENERATION COMPUTE ENGINEERED FOR A HYBRID WORLD', 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEXT GENERATION COMPUTE PORTFOLIO THAT DELIVERS A CLOUD OPERATING EXPERIENCE DESIGNED TO POWER HYBRID ENVIRONMENTS AND DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION.'}